# Frontend Routes & Pages — Template (Domain-Agnostic)

## Routes (example)
```ts
routesService.add([
  { path: '/', name: '::Menu:Home', iconClass: 'fas fa-home', order: 1 },
  { path: '/resources', name: '::Menu:Resources', iconClass: 'fas fa-database', order: 2, requiredPolicy: 'App.Resource' },
  { path: '/relations', name: '::Menu:Relations', iconClass: 'fas fa-link', order: 3, requiredPolicy: 'App.Relation' }
]);
```

## Components to generate (suggested)
- resources/resource-list
- resources/resource-detail
- resources/resource-create
- resources/resource-edit

## Forms (Reactive)
- الحقول النموذجية: name, description, startAt, endAt, location, taxonomyAId, taxonomyBId.

## Proxy Generation
```
abp generate-proxy -t ng
```

## i18n Keys
- locales/ar.json و en.json (مفاتيح عامة مثل Menu:Resources/Relations).

## LeptonX
- اتبع frontend/leptonx-setup.md.
